{"title":"2017 OIM Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/7/097569af11a8c230c95e6550101ff0b0e7ac7958.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n &gt; 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" /> be an even positive integer and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/1/5214ae0e0ea07dc3f4fa0d3b0fc04e7e0b7e6e2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1 &lt; a_2 &lt; \\cdots &lt; a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"15\" /> real numbers such that\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/6/07699978dbd5b2b4730a004199a4be8a3043c915.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{k+1} -a_k \\le 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"18\" /> for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/6/6869f10aa45b75170e88553db469d38fa7771853.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le k le n-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"102\" height=\"17\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> be the set of pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/1/811480f547c16afc74ffca555e4fd6c166ccfa68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(i, j)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/3/5c3345ae7ea8d27099b0deecc3cec6a0cbef801b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le i &lt; j \\le n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/b/e4ba06aba5e470cab970a5fa8c7d907dda35d459.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j - i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"17\" /> even, and let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> be the set of pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/1/811480f547c16afc74ffca555e4fd6c166ccfa68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(i, j)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" /> with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/3/5c3345ae7ea8d27099b0deecc3cec6a0cbef801b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\le i &lt; j \\le n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"109\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/b/e4ba06aba5e470cab970a5fa8c7d907dda35d459.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$j - i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"39\" height=\"17\" /> odd. Show that\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/8/518ee51c6441e7bc32a51edbbb852deb017b4ad1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\prod_{(i,j)\\in A}^{}(a_j-a_i)&gt;\\prod_{(i,j)\\in B}^{}(a_j-a_i)\\]\" width=\"246\" height=\"41\" />\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2017_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i> \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_OIM_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OIM_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"OIM Problems and Solutions\">OIM Problems and Solutions</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017142654\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.011 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.014 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 86/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2567/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.369      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    5.369      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:26262:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017142654 and revision id 207377. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}